# =========================================================================
# Production Environment Variables Guide (Vercel Hosting)
# =========================================================================
#
# WHY YOU SEE net::ERR_NAME_NOT_RESOLVED:
# Do NOT copy "your-production-project-id" literally into Vercel!
# You must use your actual active Supabase project credentials.
#
# INSTRUCTIONS FOR VERCEL DASHBOARD:
# 1. Open your project on Vercel: https://vercel.com/dashboard
# 2. Go to: Settings -> Environment Variables
# 3. Add Variable 1:
#      Key:   VITE_SUPABASE_URL
#      Value: https://udtajzpgrgltkdvcvttm.supabase.co
# 4. Add Variable 2:
#      Key:   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#      Value: sb_publishable_zB1s-1CQvxmfXz_YwK0yCg_nWlgY2mg
# 5. Environments to check: [x] Production  [x] Preview  [x] Development
# 6. Click Save and trigger a Redeploy on Vercel (Deployments -> ... -> Redeploy)
# =========================================================================

